     "when": "04/01/2026 06:56 PM",
     "body": "Hey Team,\n\nGreat meeting with you and I wanted to follow up with a clear breakdown of the next level of strategy we discussed and how we scale your marketing into a much larger national presence while also increasing the flow of cars you can buy/consign directly.\n\nBased on our conversation, the next phase is built around two core initiatives: Mass Generator SEO campaigns and the Vehicle Acquisitions Program. Together, these address both sides of the business,expanding your reach nationally for selling cars, while also creating a consistent pipeline of vehicles you can purchase directly.\n\nAll I need is an \"I approve\", to get the design team going and the initial fees billed out.\n\nNext steps:\n\n1. You approve\n\n2. Design for the Sell your Car landing page/ads and first mass gen begin\n\n3. I get agency access to run ads on your behalf in meta under your own ad account\n\n4. You approve designs, we build and launch the car buying first and ~3-4 weeks later we can launch the first mass generator.\n\n5. Mass generator 2 and 3 design gets started, and is being worked on in the background to launch on time.\n\nMass Generator SEO Campaigns (3 Total One Per Month)\n\nThis is the strategy we discussed to expand your reach beyond Tampa and rank in hundreds of cities for high-intent search terms. These pages are designed specifically to rank for {brand} for sale in {city} type searches, which are some of the highest buyer-intent searches in the automotive space. We will build ontop of the success of the general exotics for sale mass gen, and get a little bit more specific with common makes you carry.\n\nWe will be building three separate mass generators, we can change targets to other brands if needed before design approval:\n\n Lamborghini for sale in {town}\n McLaren for sale in {town}\n Porsche for sale in {town} --- specifically focused on Turbo and GT cars\n\nEach mass generator targets hundreds of cities across the U.S. (plus additional smaller Florida markets), creating a massive SEO footprint and allowing you to compete nationally for these specific brands and models. These pages are built to rank, bring in organic traffic, and generate inbound leads from outside your local market.\n\nBuying Cars Program\n\nThis program is designed to generate a steady flow of people looking to sell their exotic or luxury car directly to you. This is done through highly targeted Facebook and Instagram campaigns aimed specifically at owners of luxury and exotic vehicles, sending them to a high-conversion landing page where they submit their vehicle information.\n\nThis becomes a consistent source of inbound opportunities for purchasing vehicles and gives you more chances to buy the right cars at the right price rather than waiting for them to come through auctions or consignments.\n\nMonthly / Project Investment\n\nMass Generators:\n $4,999 per mass generator (3 total, one per month)\n\nBuying Cars Program:\n $999/month management\n $499 one-time setup\n Recommended starting ad spend: $2,500/month\n\nThis strategy puts you in a position where you are ranking in hundreds of cities for Lamborghini, McLaren, and Porsche searches while also building a predictable pipeline of inbound opportunities from people looking to sell you their cars. It expands your reach nationally on the sales side and strengthens your inventory acquisition on the buying side at the same time.\n\nLet me know and I can get started on the Buying Cars program and begin planning the Lamborghini mass generator for month one.\n\nAll my best,\n\nIvaylo\nAll Auto Network",
