     "body": "Ivaylo, I sent this slack to everyone today, and I'll follow up with a phone call. Thanks, KC\n\nHi Chris,\nI hope youre doing well! I'm reaching out regarding the AAN Master template ticket. Could you please provide a status update on your portion of the project? Additionally, could you let me know if you anticipate completing testing by the end of the day on Tuesday, August 11th?\nThank you so much! https://reseller.aansupport.com/admin.php?module=tickets&a=form&pg=ViewMyAssigned&id=48166",
