     "who": "Bill Simons",
     "when": "08/20/2026 04:32 PM",
     "body": "I've done my initial testing and lots of notes.\n\nI would like to test again once those items are fixed and also to review code closer too.\n\nI've seen a lot of new nice features added which is awesome.\n\nWhen we do decide to start using it I think we should install on one site and build that out while maybe others get older install and just work out the kinks on one new dealer at a time and if Sergey (or whomever) builds them and finds bugs he can report so we can fix it on master if it is not something he caused.",
