     "body": "Hi Ivaylo,\n\nTheir feed is in our newest feed system so any time a new file is sent to us it processes shortly after it lands on our FTP. So it can update as many times a day that DealerCenter can send to us. \n\nI looked into dbase settings and the feed.\n\nNothing should be tagging cars sold if they have manually added the cars into AAN system directly as the feed should only touch cars that are associated with the feed itself, but if they enter a car manually into AAN again and it disappears please let us know the stock # so we can look into when it happens.\n\nIf the car was ever in the feed though and then removed from feed it is associated with the feed and the feed would tag it sold when not present in the feed.",
